  "title": "Computation, parameters and executable plans",
  "description": "Family interpretation derives computation and parameter transformations from an authenticated source. Typed programs or retained operator schedules carry symbolic parameters; Transformation IR produces encoded package terminals. Parameter resolution joins computation with exact terminal lineage, shape and layout. Physical programs and model plans enter the runtime binding. Deployment separately checks numerical implementation, backend operations, workspace and state capacity. DeepSeek's retained operator schedule is not uniform full-model SSA execution.",
